---
/* Problem vs Solution Comparison Component */
---

<section class="comparison-section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="comparison-grid">
      
      <!-- Card 1: The Problem -->
      <div class="card problem-card">
        <div class="badge problem-badge">
          <span class="badge-icon">⚠️</span> THE PROBLEM
        </div>
        <h2>Why do most local business websites fail to convert?</h2>
        <p class="description">
          A generic website isn't enough anymore. Outdated templates, slow load times, and poor mobile design cause potential customers to leave before seeing what you offer.
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-list problem-list">
          <li>Slow, outdated sites that lose mobile visitors</li>
          <li>Poor Google visibility despite spending on ads</li>
          <li>Generic templates that fail to build trust</li>
          <li>No clear path from site visitor to paying client</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <!-- Card 2: The Solution -->
      <div class="card solution-card">
        <div class="badge solution-badge">
          <span class="badge-icon">⚡</span> THE WEB DESIGN PROS WAY
        </div>
        <h2>Engineered for speed, built for local growth</h2>
        <p class="description">
          We combine modern web architecture with strategic conversion design. Every line of code is optimized so your site loads fast, ranks high, and turns clicks into calls.
        </p>
        <ul class="bullet-list solution-list">
          <li>Core Web Vitals optimized for local SA websites</li>
          <li>SEO-ready architecture built-in from day one</li>
          <li>Custom design tailored specifically to your brand</li>
          <li>Conversion-focused layouts with clear action paths</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .comparison-section {
    padding: 5rem 2rem;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .comparison-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr));
    gap: 2rem;
  }

  .card {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
    backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 2.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .badge {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 1px;
    padding: 0.35rem 0.85rem;
    border-radius: 20px;
    width: fit-content;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
  }

  .problem-badge {
    background: rgba(255, 99, 132, 0.15);
    color: #FF6384;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 99, 132, 0.3);
  }

  .solution-badge {
    background: rgba(158, 234, 252, 0.15);
    color: #9EEAFC;
    border: 1px solid rgba(158, 234, 252, 0.3);
  }

  h2 {
    font-size: 1.85rem;
    color: #ffffff;
    line-height: 1.3;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .description {
    font-size: 1rem;
    opacity: 0.85;
    line-height: 1.6;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .bullet-list {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.85rem;
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .bullet-list li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.4;
    padding-left: 1.75rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .problem-list li::before {
    content: "•";
    color: #FF6384;
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: -0.2rem;
  }

  .solution-list li::before {
    content: "✓";
    color: #9EEAFC;
    font-weight: bold;
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    top: 0;
  }
</style>